# GitHub rejects regular Git objects over 100 MiB and Git LFS cannot serve
# GitHub Pages sites. The Pages workflow downloads this one large Unity payload
# from the `unity-webgl-v1` GitHub Release before building the deploy artifact.
public/unity/Build/WebGL.data.unityweb
